00:31:30.530 --> 00:31:32.269
And you can actually cordon off that

00:31:32.270 --> 00:31:33.439
kind of feature comparison or that

00:31:33.440 --> 00:31:35.629
kind of dimensionality comparison

00:31:35.630 --> 00:31:38.089
inside of a different set of

00:31:38.090 --> 00:31:39.949
parts of the objective that are

00:31:39.950 --> 00:31:41.719
only open to certain types of people

00:31:41.720 --> 00:31:42.709
or certain folks with certain

00:31:42.710 --> 00:31:43.710
