00:31:44.480 --> 00:31:46.519
And so all this information is here,

00:31:46.520 --> 00:31:47.749
and the idea is that once you've

00:31:47.750 --> 00:31:49.129
sort of made our selection and

00:31:49.130 --> 00:31:50.599
tagged, the model is being ready for

00:31:50.600 --> 00:31:51.919
production.

00:31:51.920 --> 00:31:53.329
The kind of key step here, the kind

00:31:53.330 --> 00:31:55.159
of coronation is we're then

00:31:55.160 --> 00:31:57.079
going to actually bind this

00:31:57.080 --> 00:31:58.999
