00:31:59.000 --> 00:32:00.529
Now this is key because this is

00:32:00.530 --> 00:32:02.149
basically giving us a type system

00:32:02.150 --> 00:32:03.289
for the models.

00:32:03.290 --> 00:32:04.249
And so what you see here at the

00:32:04.250 --> 00:32:05.239
bottom here with the modeling

00:32:05.240 --> 00:32:07.249
objective API is

00:32:07.250 --> 00:32:08.329
the winning model, which in this

00:32:08.330 --> 00:32:10.279
case was a SageMaker model

00:32:10.280 --> 00:32:12.349
is actually going to take,

00:32:12.350 --> 00:32:14.209
as two of its inputs, two

00:32:14.210 --> 00:32:16.129
properties from the ontology

00:32:16.130 --> 00:32:17.629
from from our supply chain ontology.

00:32:17.630 --> 00:32:18.649
We've been working with this entire

00:32:18.650 --> 00:32:20.299
time, so it's going to take the

00:32:20.300 --> 00:32:21.559
