00:32:21.560 --> 00:32:23.269
It's going to take in the price into

00:32:23.270 --> 00:32:25.039
this live inference end point.

00:32:25.040 --> 00:32:26.929
And then every time it returns a

00:32:26.930 --> 00:32:28.849
