00:32:28.850 --> 00:32:30.172
to basically take those three values

00:32:30.173 --> 00:32:32.119
- demand, capacity, inventory -

00:32:32.120 --> 00:32:33.979
and map those back onto the

00:32:33.980 --> 00:32:35.989
