00:32:41.660 --> 00:32:43.579
have configured the ontology

00:32:43.580 --> 00:32:45.599
to basically have

00:32:45.600 --> 00:32:47.299
to recognize to be aware of the fact

00:32:47.300 --> 00:32:48.409
