00:32:50.090 --> 00:32:51.619
And so this is huge because what

00:32:51.620 --> 00:32:52.939
this means is, with this binding in

00:32:52.940 --> 00:32:54.889
place, I can now use this

00:32:54.890 --> 00:32:56.839
