00:32:56.840 --> 00:32:58.789
you know, ----- it's been competed,

00:32:58.790 --> 00:32:59.989
it's one it's now bound to the

00:32:59.990 --> 00:33:00.829
ontology.

00:33:00.830 --> 00:33:02.509
I can now through that ontology

00:33:02.510 --> 00:33:04.069
