00:33:09.920 --> 00:33:10.969
users.

00:33:10.970 --> 00:33:12.649
And so as an example of how that

00:33:12.650 --> 00:33:13.879
kind of comes together here in this

00:33:13.880 --> 00:33:15.469
kind of takes us to kind of our

00:33:15.470 --> 00:33:17.119
final mile, which is sort of

00:33:17.120 --> 00:33:19.189
operational applications.

