00:42:57.060 --> 00:42:58.379
But the more important thing is, I

00:42:58.380 --> 00:43:00.029
need to now be able to kind of

00:43:00.030 --> 00:43:01.710
update my strategy and actually

00:43:02.820 --> 00:43:04.859
operate now in this sort of very

00:43:04.860 --> 00:43:06.449
volatile environment, which it was

00:43:06.450 --> 00:43:07.529
last year. Right. So there were

00:43:07.530 --> 00:43:09.659
