00:43:14.520 --> 00:43:16.079
able to simulate kind of different

00:43:16.080 --> 00:43:17.909
scenarios that were exigent day in

00:43:17.910 --> 00:43:19.109
and day out.

00:43:19.110 --> 00:43:20.219
What would happen if one of our

00:43:20.220 --> 00:43:21.989
