00:43:32.490 --> 00:43:33.689
given how we're currently doing

00:43:33.690 --> 00:43:34.769
allocation, how we're currently

00:43:34.770 --> 00:43:37.229
doing different supply tactics?

00:43:37.230 --> 00:43:39.149
And so what we can open up here is

00:43:39.150 --> 00:43:41.129
actually a simulation tab

00:43:41.130 --> 00:43:42.539
to think about running those

00:43:42.540 --> 00:43:44.039
