00:43:44.040 --> 00:43:45.869
directly on top

00:43:45.870 --> 00:43:47.939
of sandbox versions of your

00:43:47.940 --> 00:43:50.999
world, right, of the full ontology.

00:43:51.000 --> 00:43:52.079
And so we can actually simulate

00:43:52.080 --> 00:43:53.909
directly here, given that we

00:43:53.910 --> 00:43:55.079
have the data in the models
connected,

00:43:55.080 --> 00:43:56.669
what would happen if that supplier

00:43:56.670 --> 00:43:58.499
went offline, for instance, and you

00:43:58.500 --> 00:44:00.299
can kind of run these simulations as

00:44:00.300 --> 00:44:02.309
