00:44:14.450 --> 00:44:16.129
would have across kind of every

00:44:16.130 --> 00:44:17.719
dependent property that we have

00:44:17.720 --> 00:44:19.759
here, kind of modeled

00:44:19.760 --> 00:44:21.199
in the ontology.

00:44:21.200 --> 00:44:22.159
And so that's a very trivial

00:44:22.160 --> 00:44:24.019
